{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/221","id":4817522787,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTEdTLM8AAAABHyWQYw","html_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/221","diff_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/221.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/221.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/issues/221","number":221,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Formalize Euclidean prescient mirror descent on the actual run","user":{"login":"jicheng9617","id":74550583,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTUwNTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74550583?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617","html_url":"https://github.com/jicheng9617","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Specialize Orabona v10 Algorithm 15.8 / Theorem 15.30 to quadratic Euclidean geometry on the same actual partial prescient run. The new API proves the actual gradient and divergence identity, then both variable-step and fixed-step regret bounds with the full negative squared-movement term. The fixed-step proof left as an exercise is included.\n\nThe run conclusions are conditional on supplied feasible attained quadratic updates, with arbitrary EReal losses satisfying the audited global-support/domain/no-bottom premises. Scoring uses the updated point; the variable maximum uses previous states and the final played step. The fixed theorem permits T=0. Two nonaffine, top-outside-domain canaries consume both run and bound conjuncts of the respective new production theorem.\n\nThe shared Book mapping adds one coherent source-card group and three declaration-bound lessons. All 11,101 old registry objects and all old cards/lessons are preserved; three new canonical nodes are added. Source topology, selected actual VALUE parents and conceptual transport remain distinct. Mathlib dependency names remain visible in notes and compiled evidence; they are not invented as local registry nodes.\n\nValidation on source candidate `3b393adb009bc25a2c6e3fa3148bf9a3a2b4c376`:\n\n- Lean root: 9,123 jobs; Tests: 9,305 jobs.\n- Full harness: 474 tests passed, 7 configured skips; only the three standard axioms in new declaration exports.\n- Contributor contract, process memory, plain site preflight, Lean-verified build, official site check, structural preservation and isolated desktop reader capture all passed with unchanged RAW inputs and exact selected ZIP snapshots.\n- Eight original screenshots and exact HTTP-to-local-page byte bindings are retained in `runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/final-validation-evidence-v1`.\n\nIndependent bounded FINAL acceptance is recorded in `runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/final-validation-evidence-v1/fresh-independent-final-review-v1.json` (SHA256 `50ebc5f41c81598692cd3bfc28aa058abeccdc9abfc60a9a6e34efb2bea21d24`); parent bounded acceptance is `60375da192caed9074400614a15ce1290d84a7a3af4f1614261cacbcef0484fe`. The bounded local Exposition Seal passed; purification remains pending. Historical failed proof attempts, evidence/transport repairs and the failed Mathlib-link site preflight are retained. The author optimality/global-support justification remains a source gap; the checked proximal implementation route does not erase it. Latest source-first governance was adopted incrementally after the legacy statement freeze: no retroactive preproof topology gate or native whole-loop acceptance is claimed.\n\nThis is stacked on #220. `main` at `fea256b1c03b14b79c6c84a965e8ac2b5a738f64` was merged into this branch. Only `later:lookahead/branch-03` is accepted locally; the prescient container and mandatory `repair:7.47-terminal` / `repair:15.31-terminal` remain open. Seven required Chapter 2 containers and six future mathematical claims remain open. Chapter 2 remains partial with a null complete proof denominator, and the Chapters 1–16 Goal remains ACTIVE. This PR does not update main or the live site; purification remains pending.\n\nDelivery commit: `2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6`. The later evidence commit preserves every active source input from the combined-gate candidate. CI status is tracked separately; local gates are not a GitHub CI verdict.\n","created_at":"2026-10-11T07:49:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T07:49:15Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"ed02d6159d25d59aa05b02a77a09fce8d50f0017","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/221/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/221/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/issues/221/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/statuses/2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6","head":{"label":"DakeBU:codex/research-online-ch2-prescient-euclidean","ref":"codex/research-online-ch2-prescient-euclidean","sha":"2615db818e